    "U": "证据片段：'A listing of the computer science offerings from Oregon university System campuses and other Oregon colleges. >Need to determine extent of community and private colleges in Oregon' – 需求基本意图可理解，但第二部分以'>'开头，表示不完整或附加说明，降低了整体可理解性，使得用户可能困惑于这是需求还是注释。",
    "A": "证据片段：'Oregon university System campuses' 和 'extent of community and private colleges' – 术语如'Oregon university System'未定义，可能指特定系统或泛称；'other Oregon colleges'范围模糊；'extent'未明确指规模、数量或类型，导致歧义，不同利益相关者可能有不同解释。",
    "C": "证据片段：'>Need to determine extent of community and private colleges in Oregon' – 这部分表述为'需要确定某事'，更像一个任务或需求分析点，而不是一个可执行、正确的系统需求陈述，可能不完整或不适用于软件实现。",
    "V": "证据片段：'A listing' 和 'extent' – 需求未指定列表的格式、内容或输出方式，且'extent'未定义如何测量或验证，缺乏明确的可测试标准，使得需求无法通过测试用例验证。"
  },
  "suggestions": {
    "U": "The system shall provide a list of all computer science courses offered by campuses of the Oregon University System and other colleges in Oregon. Additionally, the system shall determine and include information on community and private colleges in Oregon that offer such courses.",
    "A": "Define 'Oregon University System' as the public university system comprising specific campuses in Oregon, and 'other Oregon colleges' as all accredited higher education institutions in Oregon excluding those in the Oregon University System. Specify 'extent' as the count and classification (community or private) of colleges offering computer science courses.",
    "C": "The system shall generate a comprehensive listing of computer science offerings from Oregon University System campuses and other Oregon colleges, and it shall explicitly include data on community and private colleges in Oregon, such as their names and course offerings.",
    "V": "The list shall be output in a structured format (e.g., a database table or CSV file) with columns for college name, type (e.g., public, community, private), and course names. The determination of community and private colleges shall be verifiable by cross-referencing with an authoritative source like the Oregon Higher Education Coordinating Commission database."
