    {"type": "U", "evidence": "A listing of the computer science offerings from Oregon university System campuses and other Oregon colleges. >Need to determine extent of community and private colleges in Oregon", "rewrite": "The system shall provide a list of all computer science courses offered by campuses of the Oregon University System and other accredited colleges in Oregon. Additionally, the system shall determine and include data on community and private colleges in Oregon that offer computer science courses, specifying their names and types."},
    {"type": "A", "evidence": "Oregon university System campuses and other Oregon colleges", "rewrite": "Define 'Oregon University System' as the public university system in Oregon with campuses listed in official documentation, and 'other Oregon colleges' as all other higher education institutions in Oregon accredited to offer computer science programs. Specify that 'extent' refers to the number and categories (community or private) of such colleges."},
    {"type": "C", "evidence": ">Need to determine extent of community and private colleges in Oregon", "rewrite": "The system shall determine and include information on community and private colleges in Oregon that offer computer science courses, ensuring this data is part of the listing requirement."},
